        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-06-22T15:30:55.820Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"28621\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Tuesday, July 6th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#181</span> - Writers’ Room: Disparation: Freedom Four 1776</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Huh, I didn’t know there was a Freedom Four during the Revolutionary War . . .</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"28621\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Tuesday, July 13th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#182</span> - Writers’ Room: A Body Swap Story</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Huh, this’ll be interesting, I suppose. I wonder if it’ll be two Heroes, a Hero and a Villain, or (unlikely) two Villains, and if they’ll both be the same gender.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"28621\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Tuesday, July 27th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#183</span> - Writers’ Room: Clone-Ranger vs CON</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>How exciting is that going to be? Can CON even defend itself in any way?</p>",
