        "raw": "[quote=\"Powerhound_2000, post:1, topic:28621\"]\nTuesday, July 6th: Episode #181 - Writers’ Room: Disparation: Freedom Four 1776\n[/quote]\n\nHuh, I didn't know there was a Freedom Four during the Revolutionary War . . .\n\n[quote=\"Powerhound_2000, post:1, topic:28621\"]\nTuesday, July 13th: Episode #182 - Writers’ Room: A Body Swap Story\n[/quote]\n\nHuh, this'll be interesting, I suppose. I wonder if it'll be two Heroes, a Hero and a Villain, or (unlikely) two Villains, and if they'll both be the same gender.\n\n[quote=\"Powerhound_2000, post:1, topic:28621\"]\nTuesday, July 27th: Episode #183 - Writers’ Room: Clone-Ranger vs CON\n[/quote]\n\nHow exciting is that going to be? Can CON even defend itself in any way?",
