        "created_at": "2021-06-22T23:00:58.390Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I listened to this in the car today, so I didn’t take any notes. But I do have to ask, <em>what</em> was that stinger? XD</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"28621\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It’s Disparation so timeline wise it doesn’t have to make sense. Really the only hero I expect to be the direct line to Legacy is Joseph Parsons. Beyond that I’m not sure who will be used for a 1776 Tachyon, Bunker, or Wraith.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It’s gotta have Haka, right? He was around then, and he’s been on the F4 before!</p>",
